      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Pilate gave in to the crowd and handed Jesus over to be crucified. Jesus carried his own cross to a hill called Golgotha.",
          "ko": "빌라도는 무리에게 굴복해서 예수님을 십자가형에 넘겨주었어요. 예수님은 골고다라는 언덕까지 자신의 십자가를 직접 지고 가셨어요."
        },
        {
          "text": "Soldiers put Jesus on the cross between two other men. Above his head, they placed a sign that read, \"The King of the Jews.\"",
